<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
	<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
	<title>Affichette QR avis Google — Admin</title>
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/qrcodejs/1.0.0/qrcode.min.js"></script>
	<style>
		* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
		body { font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; background: #0b1220; color: #F2F4F7; min-height: 100vh; }
		.tool { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 340px 1fr; gap: 40px; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 24px; align-items: start; }
		.side h1 { font-family: "Space Grotesk"; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
		.side p.help { color: #9aa5b4; font-size: .88rem; margin-bottom: 22px; line-height: 1.5; }
		.side label { display: block; color: #9aa5b4; font-size: .82rem; margin: 16px 0 6px; }
		.side input, .side textarea { width: 100%; background: #0f1319; border: 1px solid #2a323f; color: #F2F4F7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; font: inherit; font-size: .92rem; }
		.side input:focus, .side textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: #34d399; }
		.side .btn { margin-top: 24px; width: 100%; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 13px; font: 600 .95rem Inter; color: #04201a; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #34d399, #22d3ee); cursor: pointer; }
		.side .back { display: inline-block; margin-top: 18px; color: #9aa5b4; font-size: .85rem; text-decoration: none; }
		.side .tip { margin-top: 22px; font-size: .8rem; color: #6b7480; line-height: 1.5; border-top: 1px solid #1d232d; padding-top: 16px; }

		/* Affichette A5 : 148 x 210 mm */
		.sheet { width: 148mm; height: 210mm; background: #fff; color: #0b1220; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.6);
			display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 16mm 14mm 12mm; text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
		.sheet::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 0; height: 7mm; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #34d399, #22d3ee); }
		.sheet .shop { font-family: "Space Grotesk"; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20pt; line-height: 1.1; margin-top: 4mm; }
		.sheet .ask { font-family: "Space Grotesk"; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26pt; line-height: 1.1; margin-top: 6mm; }
		.sheet .stars { font-size: 20pt; letter-spacing: 3mm; color: #f5b301; margin-top: 4mm; }
		.sheet .qr { padding: 5mm; border: 1.2mm solid #0b1220; border-radius: 6mm; margin: 6mm 0; }
		.sheet .qr img, .sheet .qr canvas { width: 62mm !important; height: 62mm !important; display: block; }
		.sheet .how { font-size: 11.5pt; color: #333d4b; line-height: 1.4; max-width: 105mm; }
		.sheet .thanks { font-family: "Space Grotesk"; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13pt; margin-top: 4mm; }
		.sheet .foot { font-size: 7pt; color: #9aa5b4; }

		@media (max-width: 900px) { .tool { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .sheet { zoom: .55; } }

		@page { size: A5; margin: 0; }
		@media print {
			body { background: #fff; }
			.side { display: none; }
			.tool { display: block; padding: 0; margin: 0; max-width: none; }
			.sheet { box-shadow: none; border-radius: 0; transform: none; }
			.sheet::before { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="tool">
		<aside class="side">
			<h1>Affichette QR avis</h1>
			<p class="help">Remplis les champs, vérifie l'aperçu, puis « Enregistrer en PDF ». Choisis « Enregistrer au format PDF » comme imprimante, format A5, marges aucune.</p>

			<label for="shop">Nom du commerce</label>
			<input id="shop" value="Boulangerie Dupont" autocomplete="off">

			<label for="url">Lien d'avis Google</label>
			<input id="url" value="https://g.page/r/VOTRE-ID/review" autocomplete="off">

			<label for="ask">Phrase d'accroche</label>
			<input id="ask" value="Votre avis compte !">

			<label for="how">Texte explicatif</label>
			<textarea id="how" rows="3">Scannez le QR code avec l'appareil photo de votre téléphone et laissez-nous quelques mots sur Google.</textarea>

			<button class="btn" type="button" onclick="window.print()">Enregistrer en PDF</button>
			<a class="back" href="{{ path('admin_offers') }}">← Retour au back-office</a>

			<p class="tip">Le lien d'avis se trouve dans le profil Google du client : « Demander des avis » → « Partager le formulaire d'avis ». Il commence en général par g.page/r/.</p>
		</aside>

		<div class="sheet" id="sheet">
			<div>
				<div class="shop" data-bind="shop"></div>
				<div class="ask" data-bind="ask"></div>
				<div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
			</div>
			<div class="qr" id="qr"></div>
			<div>
				<p class="how" data-bind="how"></p>
				<p class="thanks">Merci !</p>
			</div>
			<div class="foot">Avis publiés sur Google</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<script>
		(function () {
			var fields = ['shop', 'ask', 'how'];
			var qrBox = document.getElementById('qr');
			var urlInput = document.getElementById('url');

			function drawQr() {
				qrBox.innerHTML = '';
				if (typeof QRCode === 'undefined') {
					qrBox.textContent = 'QR indisponible (connexion au CDN requise).';
					return;
				}
				new QRCode(qrBox, { text: urlInput.value.trim() || ' ', width: 512, height: 512, correctLevel: QRCode.CorrectLevel.M });
			}

			function sync() {
				fields.forEach(function (id) {
					document.querySelector('[data-bind="' + id + '"]').textContent = document.getElementById(id).value;
				});
				document.title = 'QR avis — ' + document.getElementById('shop').value;
			}

			fields.forEach(function (id) { document.getElementById(id).addEventListener('input', sync); });
			urlInput.addEventListener('input', drawQr);
			sync();
			drawQr();
		})();
	</script>
</body>
</html>
